# Appended to the .config of every package shard. plan-shards.py reads the
# disabled symbols too, so that it leaves out the dependencies they guard.

# Mesa's LLVM-based drivers need LLVM built first, about four hours of one
# runner, which no shard can afford on top of its own packages. These boards
# have no GPU. Softpipe and the other LLVM-free drivers remain.
# CONFIG_MESA_USE_LLVM is not set
# These two Vulkan drivers lack that dependency, so they would still pull in
# Mesa's Vulkan build, which then fails.
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_libvulkan-imagination is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_libvulkan-virtio is not set
